{"schema":"hsr-dialogue.v1","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-17","referenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","textReferenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","sourceIds":["event-rogue-17"],"missing":0,"rows":[{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-17-talk-403811401-line","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-17","missionId":"event-rogue-17","mission":"끝없는 어둠","scene":"끝없는 어둠","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"여긴 어디지…? 혼잣말을 중얼거리며, 당신은 끝없는 어둠에 빠져버렸다. 이곳에는 빛줄기 하나 없었기에, 어느 방향으로 가야 할지 알 수 없었다","talkId":403811401,"textHash":"3265945597780422667","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:17/talk-403811401","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"e6273e2730399dac","bwikiNextIds":["swarm-disaster-event-rogue-17-talk-403811402-line"],"bwikiPage":"无尽黑暗","bwikiRevision":58519,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-9211","bwikiMission":"끝없는 어둠"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-17-talk-403811402-line","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-17","missionId":"event-rogue-17","mission":"끝없는 어둠","scene":"끝없는 어둠","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"신비한 소리가 귓가를 울리더니, 거대한 힘이 당신을 끌어당겼다. 정신력이 비정상적으로 산만해졌고, 주위를 둘러싼 실체 없는 기류에 근육이 풀리고 눈이 스르륵 감긴다…","talkId":403811402,"textHash":"16706169854816834435","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:17/talk-403811402","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"e6273e2730399dac","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"无尽黑暗","bwikiRevision":58519,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-9211","bwikiMission":"끝없는 어둠"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-17-text-5765588365588892448-choice","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-17","missionId":"event-rogue-17","mission":"끝없는 어둠","scene":"끝없는 어둠","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"만끽한다…","talkId":null,"textHash":"5765588365588892448","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:17/text-5765588365588892448","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"1a1a87e0c8ef75a7","bwikiNextIds":["swarm-disaster-event-rogue-17-text-18226249884457337452-effect"],"bwikiPage":"无尽黑暗","bwikiRevision":58519,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-9211","bwikiMission":"끝없는 어둠"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-17-text-18226249884457337452-effect","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-17","missionId":"event-rogue-17","mission":"끝없는 어둠","scene":"끝없는 어둠","type":"narration","speaker":"","text":"랜덤 「공허」 축복 1개를 강화한다","talkId":null,"textHash":"18226249884457337452","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:17/text-18226249884457337452","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"1a1a87e0c8ef75a7","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"无尽黑暗","bwikiRevision":58519,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-9211","bwikiMission":"끝없는 어둠","bwikiReplyToIds":["swarm-disaster-event-rogue-17-text-5765588365588892448-choice"]},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-17-text-12230649870532727456-choice","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-17","missionId":"event-rogue-17","mission":"끝없는 어둠","scene":"끝없는 어둠","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"어둠으로 향한다","talkId":null,"textHash":"12230649870532727456","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:17/text-12230649870532727456","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"803942020e0bec57","bwikiNextIds":["swarm-disaster-event-rogue-17-text-8326837619053553248-effect"],"bwikiPage":"无尽黑暗","bwikiRevision":58519,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-9211","bwikiMission":"끝없는 어둠"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-17-text-8326837619053553248-effect","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-17","missionId":"event-rogue-17","mission":"끝없는 어둠","scene":"끝없는 어둠","type":"narration","speaker":"","text":"앞에 형태가 없는 거대한 다크 웹이 있는 것 같다…","talkId":null,"textHash":"8326837619053553248","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:17/text-8326837619053553248","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"803942020e0bec57","bwikiNextIds":["swarm-disaster-event-rogue-17-talk-403811404-line"],"bwikiPage":"无尽黑暗","bwikiRevision":58519,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-9211","bwikiMission":"끝없는 어둠","bwikiReplyToIds":["swarm-disaster-event-rogue-17-text-12230649870532727456-choice"]},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-17-talk-403811404-line","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-17","missionId":"event-rogue-17","mission":"끝없는 어둠","scene":"끝없는 어둠","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"섬뜩하고도 두려운 체험이었다. 공허가 온몸을 삼키자, 당황한 당신은 도망가기에 바빴다","talkId":403811404,"textHash":"18334373039066479881","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:17/talk-403811404","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"803942020e0bec57","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"无尽黑暗","bwikiRevision":58519,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-9211","bwikiMission":"끝없는 어둠"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-17-text-4658431180861248167-choice","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-17","missionId":"event-rogue-17","mission":"끝없는 어둠","scene":"끝없는 어둠","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"유혹을 떨쳐낸다","talkId":null,"textHash":"4658431180861248167","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:17/text-4658431180861248167","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"339109e987b6a7b2","bwikiNextIds":["swarm-disaster-event-rogue-17-text-13514957801537101088-effect"],"bwikiPage":"无尽黑暗","bwikiRevision":58519,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-9211","bwikiMission":"끝없는 어둠"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-17-text-13514957801537101088-effect","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-17","missionId":"event-rogue-17","mission":"끝없는 어둠","scene":"끝없는 어둠","type":"narration","speaker":"","text":"흐트러진 정신을 집중해야 한다","talkId":null,"textHash":"13514957801537101088","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:17/text-13514957801537101088","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"339109e987b6a7b2","bwikiNextIds":["swarm-disaster-event-rogue-17-talk-403811406-line"],"bwikiPage":"无尽黑暗","bwikiRevision":58519,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-9211","bwikiMission":"끝없는 어둠","bwikiReplyToIds":["swarm-disaster-event-rogue-17-text-4658431180861248167-choice"]},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-17-talk-403811406-line","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-17","missionId":"event-rogue-17","mission":"끝없는 어둠","scene":"끝없는 어둠","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"섬뜩하고도 두려운 체험이었다. 공허가 온몸을 삼키자, 당신은 생명력을 흡수당하는 것을 느꼈다","talkId":403811406,"textHash":"14999943198372179950","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:17/talk-403811406","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"339109e987b6a7b2","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"无尽黑暗","bwikiRevision":58519,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-9211","bwikiMission":"끝없는 어둠"}],"orderNote":"공식 사건 도감에 귀속된 한국어 원문입니다. BWIKI에서 확인한 모드별 구간만 연결하며 조건·확률·미확인 경계는 이어 붙이지 않습니다.","bwikiBaseOrder":["swarm-disaster-event-rogue-17-talk-403811401-line","swarm-disaster-event-rogue-17-talk-403811402-line","swarm-disaster-event-rogue-17-text-5765588365588892448-choice","swarm-disaster-event-rogue-17-text-18226249884457337452-effect","swarm-disaster-event-rogue-17-text-12230649870532727456-choice","swarm-disaster-event-rogue-17-text-8326837619053553248-effect","swarm-disaster-event-rogue-17-talk-403811404-line","swarm-disaster-event-rogue-17-text-4658431180861248167-choice","swarm-disaster-event-rogue-17-text-13514957801537101088-effect","swarm-disaster-event-rogue-17-talk-403811406-line"],"bwiki":{"matchedRows":0,"cachedRows":10,"reviewRows":0,"segments":4,"reorderedRows":0},"retainedTextRowIds":[]}